---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Figure from '../components/Figure.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<Base title="Operator" description="About Kartikey Pathak — robotics engineer, SRA member, occasional filmmaker, cat-feeder builder.">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="op-head">
      <p class="label">/operator · the human running the console</p>
      <h1>About me</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="op-grid">
      <img
        class="op-portrait"
        src={`${base}/assets/operator/portrait.jpg`}
        alt="Kartikey Pathak"
        width="340"
        loading="eager"
      />
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          I'm an Electrical Engineering student at VJTI, Mumbai (class of 2027,
          Minor in Robotics) who loves building robots. You can call me at
          midnight with an idea and I'll be ready to help — since my first year
          I've been making all kinds of machines and really enjoy seeing them
          come to life.
        </p>
        <p>
          What makes me happy is when my creations actually work. I don't give
          up easily: that stubbornness has carried projects from a
          first-semester gesture-controlled car to custom UWB ranging firmware
          for a defence-industry forklift.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section>
      <h2>Society of Robotics and Automation (SRA)</h2>
      <p class="prose">
        SRA is where most of this happened. Beyond my own builds, I conduct
        workshops on embedded C and ESP32, mentor junior teams building
        self-balancing and line-following robots, and teach MPU6050 integration
        and complementary-filter math. Our Wall-E workshop — where we
        manufacture, assemble, and sell self-balancing robot kits — has taught
        <strong>more than 200 students</strong>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Off the bench</h2>
      <div class="fun-grid">
        <div class="panel">
          <p class="label">leadership</p>
          <h3>Pratibimb — first in 26 years</h3>
          <p>
            Led our Electrical Engineering branch to first place in Pratibimb,
            VJTI's cultural fest — the branch's first win in 26 years. Results
            were announced on my 19th birthday. Best birthday so far.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="panel">
          <p class="label">filmmaking</p>
          <h3>"Plot Se Panga"</h3>
          <p>
            Directed and produced an original short film with my friends — it
            took first prize among all competing branches. Directing a film and
            directing a robot build have more in common than you'd think:
            both are mostly debugging.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="panel">
          <p class="label">lab resident</p>
          <h3>The SRA cat</h3>
          <p>
            Our robotics club has a cat. She has her own robot —
            <a href={`${base}/fleet/robots-for-good/`}>an automatic feeder</a> —
            so she eats even during semester breaks.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Systems map</h2>
      <p class="prose">
        Skills, stated as what they've been used for — every claim links to a
        unit in <a href={`${base}/fleet/`}>the fleet</a>.
      </p>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr><th scope="col">Domain</th><th scope="col">Tools</th><th scope="col">Proven in</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>Localization & navigation</td>
            <td>UWB (DS-TWR), SLAM, NAV2, trilateration, ArUco</td>
            <td><a href={`${base}/fleet/kdail/`}>KDAIL</a>, <a href={`${base}/fleet/eyantra/`}>e-Yantra</a></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Robot software</td>
            <td>ROS/ROS2, Gazebo (Classic→Fortress), RViz, URDF, micro-ROS</td>
            <td><a href={`${base}/fleet/mario/`}>MARIO</a>, <a href={`${base}/fleet/nishcorp/`}>NishCorp</a>, <a href={`${base}/fleet/vvm/`}>VVM</a></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Embedded systems</td>
            <td>ESP32, ESP-IDF, FreeRTOS, ESP-NOW, BLE, Raspberry Pi</td>
            <td><a href={`${base}/fleet/smart-switch/`}>Smart Switch</a>, <a href={`${base}/fleet/origins/`}>Origins</a></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Control</td>
            <td>PID, sensor fusion, complementary filters, kinematics</td>
            <td><a href={`${base}/fleet/origins/`}>Wall-E</a>, <a href={`${base}/fleet/eyantra/`}>drone flight</a></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Perception & ML</td>
            <td>OpenCV, CNNs / transfer learning, speech recognition</td>
            <td><a href={`${base}/fleet/robots-for-good/`}>Coin sorter</a>, <a href={`${base}/fleet/vvm/`}>VVM</a></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Design & fabrication</td>
            <td>KiCAD, OnShape, 3D printing, perf-board electronics</td>
            <td><a href={`${base}/fleet/smart-switch/`}>Smart Switch</a>, <a href={`${base}/fleet/kurma/`}>Kurma</a></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Languages</td>
            <td>C, C++, Python, Dart</td>
            <td>everywhere above</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>
  </div>

  <style>
    .op-head { padding-top: var(--sp-12); }
    .op-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 340px 1fr;
      gap: var(--sp-8);
      align-items: start;
      margin-bottom: var(--sp-12);
    }
    .op-portrait {
      width: 100%;
      border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    }
    .fun-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
      gap: var(--sp-4);
    }
    .fun-grid h3 { margin-top: var(--sp-2); }
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .op-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .op-portrait { max-width: 280px; }
    }
  </style>
</Base>
